{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>When you go out.</b> It is joined here to teach that the law of this pericope, concerning outside the Land, is not like the law of the pericopes above, which apply in the Land." "<b>When you go out to war.</b> The verse speaks of an optional war, for regarding a war of the Land of Israel one cannot say <b>and you take captives.</b>" "<b>And you take captives.</b> To include Canaanites among them — thus is the text of Rashi."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:53:35.465201261Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}